{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/help-with-capital-gains-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"3041b01c-2843-4946-a2d7-1bdee0802b10","description":"Find information on completing the Capital Gains section of your Self Assessment tax return.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Capital Gains Tax is a tax on the profit when you sell something that’s increased in value.</p>\n\n<p>Before you complete your tax return, you can check <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/capital-gains-tax/what-you-pay-it-on\">what you pay Capital Gains Tax on</a> and <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/capital-gains-tax/work-out-need-to-pay\">work out if you need to pay</a>.</p>\n\n<p>If you have sold or given away cryptoassets or cryptocurrencies (such as bitcoin), you can <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/check-if-you-need-to-pay-tax-when-you-sell-cryptoassets\">check if you need to pay Capital Gains Tax on cryptoassets</a>.</p>\n\n<p>If you need to pay tax after selling an asset, you can find out <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/report-and-pay-your-capital-gains-tax\">how to report and pay your Capital Gains Tax</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return\">Helpsheets for filling in your tax return</h2>\n\n<p>Helpsheets provide information that can help you complete your Self Assessment tax return, such as:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>checking if you qualify for a relief</li>\n  <li>working out figures you might need to include in your return</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"capital-gains-tax-reliefs\">Capital Gains Tax reliefs</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/entrepreneurs-relief-hs275-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Business Asset Disposal Relief (HS275)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/incorporation-relief-hs276-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Incorporation Relief (HS276)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/private-residence-relief-hs283-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Private Residence Relief (HS283)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/business-asset-roll-over-relief-hs290-self-assessment-helpsheet\">business asset roll-over relief (HS290)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/relief-for-gifts-and-similar-transactions-hs295-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Capital Gains Tax relief on gifts and similar transactions (HS295)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/investors-relief-2020-hs308\">Investors’ Relief (HS308)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/limit-on-income-tax-reliefs-hs204-self-assessment-helpsheet\">the limit on Income Tax reliefs (HS204)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"capital-gains-tax-on-shares-investments-and-debts\">Capital Gains Tax on shares, investments and debts</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/shares-and-capital-gains-tax-hs284-self-assessment-helpsheet\">shares and Capital Gains Tax (HS284)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/share-reorganisations-company-takeovers-and-capital-gains-tax-hs285-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Capital Gains Tax, share reorganisations and company takeovers (HS285)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/negligible-value-claims-and-income-tax-losses-on-disposals-of-shares-you-have-subscribed-for-in-qualifying-trading-companies-hs286-self-assessment-he\">negligible value claims and Income Tax losses on disposal of shares (HS286)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/employee-share-and-security-schemes-and-capital-gains-tax-hs287-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Capital Gains Tax and employee share schemes (HS287)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/enterprise-investment-scheme-and-capital-gains-tax-hs297-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Capital Gains Tax and the Enterprise Investment Scheme (HS297)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/venture-capital-trusts-and-capital-gains-tax-hs298-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Capital Gains Tax and venture capital trusts (HS298)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/seed-enterprise-investment-scheme-income-tax-and-capital-gains-tax-reliefs-hs393-self-assessment-helpsheet\">reliefs under the Seed Enterprise Investment Scheme (HS393)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/debts-and-capital-gains-tax-hs296-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Capital Gains Tax and debts (HS296)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"capital-gains-tax-on-land-property-and-personal-possessions\">Capital Gains Tax on land, property and personal possessions</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/land-and-leases-the-valuation-of-land-and-capital-gains-tax-hs292-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Capital Gains Tax on land and leases (HS292)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/chattels-and-capital-gains-tax-hs293-self-assessment-helpsheet\">personal possessions and Capital Gains Tax (HS293)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/non-resident-capital-gains-for-land-and-property-in-the-uk-self-assessment-helpsheet-hs307\">non-resident Capital Gains for land and property in the UK (HS307)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"capital-gains-tax-for-trusts\">Capital Gains tax for trusts</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/trusts-and-capital-gains-tax-hs294-self-assessment-helpsheet\">trusts and Capital Gains Tax (HS294)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/non-resident-trusts-and-capital-gains-tax-hs299-self-assessment-helpsheet\">non-resident trusts and Capital Gains Tax (HS299)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/beneficiaries-receiving-capital-payments-from-non-resident-trusts-and-the-calculation-of-the-increase-in-tax-charge-hs301-self-assessment-helpsheet\">beneficiaries receiving capital payments from non-resident trust (HS301)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"other-capital-gains-helpsheets\">Other Capital Gains helpsheets</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/temporary-non-residents-and-capital-gains-tax-hs278-self-assessment-helpsheet\">temporary non-residents and Capital Gains Tax (HS278)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/husband-and-wife-civil-partners-divorce-dissolution-and-separation-hs281-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Capital Gains Tax, civil partners and spouses (HS281)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/death-personal-representatives-and-legatees-hs282-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Capital Gains Tax when someone dies (HS282)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/partnerships-and-capital-gains-tax-hs288-self-assessment-helpsheet\">partnerships and Capital Gains Tax (HS288)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"hmrc-youtube-videos\">HMRC YouTube videos</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"property-disposals\">Property disposals</h3>\n\n<p>Watch a video about reporting and paying Capital Gains Tax on property disposals.</p>\n\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JKskdn7CnwM\">How do I report and pay Capital Gains Tax on property disposals?</a></p>\n\n<p>You will learn about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>who Capital Gains on disposals of property  applies to</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>what to do if you are a non-UK resident</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>how to report and pay Capital Gains on property disposals</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"allowable-expenditure\">Allowable expenditure</h3>\n\n<p>Watch a video about the allowable expenditure you can claim.</p>\n\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_rJt4b3YfOg&amp;list=PL8EcnheDt1zi_oCPYLN-oa_zzf8L2Tqwa&amp;index=7\">What allowable expenditure can I claim against Capital Gains Tax?</a></p>\n\n<p>You will learn about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>allowable expenditure</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>costs not allowed</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>special rules for using the market value as the cost</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"cryptoassets\">Cryptoassets</h3>\n\n<p>Watch a video about how crypto transactions are taxed for individuals.</p>\n\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PJtKRHGV4iE\">Cryptoassets and paying tax</a></p>\n\n<p>You will learn about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>categories of cryptoassets</li>\n  <li>types of disposals</li>\n  <li>receiving crypto</li>\n  <li>declaring cryptoasset income or gains</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The section on registering for webinars has been removed.","public_timestamp":"2025-06-02T13:59:46Z"},{"note":"Added Welsh translation","public_timestamp":"2025-04-15T12:18:30Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-01-22T00:00:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"first_public_at":"2025-01-22T00:00:00.000+00:00","headers":[{"headers":[{"id":"capital-gains-tax-reliefs","level":3,"text":"Capital Gains Tax reliefs"},{"id":"capital-gains-tax-on-shares-investments-and-debts","level":3,"text":"Capital Gains Tax on shares, investments and debts"},{"id":"capital-gains-tax-on-land-property-and-personal-possessions","level":3,"text":